{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "关于叛徒问题的指示（一九六七年六月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n314)\n关于叛徒问题的指示\n（一九六七年六月）\n对于叛徒，除罪大恶极者外，在其不继续反共的条件下，予以自新出路。如能回头革命，还可以接待。但不能重新入党。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-86364c575f1c70d1da28", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-314.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "23aef203b843f9caffde11cb6f9c92214eeee337037b11de4efd3761fd128ed5", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "be21e9ce84a81aeb6bfcd2db698b2f9f315426b5397e07d722bab17526de113f", "text_chars": 146}
